> east
Chasm
A chasm runs southwest to northeast. You are on the east edge.

> east
North/South Passage
This is a wide passage running north and south. The walls are damp and cold.

> northeast
Loud Room
This is a large room with a ceiling which cannot be detected from the ground. A narrow passage leads east; a stairway leads up. The room is extremely noisy.

> east
Ancient Chasm
You are at the edge of an ancient chasm. Passages lead in several directions.

> south
Basin Room
You are in a small room with a stone basin in the center.

> burn incense
The incense begins to smolder, releasing fragrant smoke that fills the room.

> pray
The room fills with a warm, golden light. The fog in the basin clears, revealing holy water.

> drop frame piece
Dropped.

The fragrant smoke swirls around the basin. A spectral figure rises - the ghost of the thief! Dressed in adventurer's robes, he gestures toward the Gallery and speaks: "Well done, my friend. You are nearing the end game. Look to the Gallery for your reward." Then he fades away...

A magnificent rolled up canvas has appeared in the Gallery!

The incense sputters and burns out completely, leaving only ash.

