> up
Living Room
This is the living room. There is a door to the east. To the west is a wooden door with strange gothic lettering, which appears to be nailed shut. A trophy case takes up one corner of the room. A large oriental rug lies to one side of the room, moved away from the trap door it once covered.

You can see a skeleton key, a large brochure, a wrench, a brass bell, a black book, a burned-out candles, a sharp stick, a blue blue cake, an eat-me eat-me cake, and an elongated brown sack here.

